<title>JAPAN: Aderans says to buy back up to two mln shares.</title>
<headline>Aderans says to buy back up to two mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aderans Co Ltd, a leading male wig maker, said on Monday that it would buy back up to two million of its shares worth a total of five billion yen.</p>
<p>The repurchase is subject to approval by a regular shareholders meeting in late May, Aderans said.</p>
<p>As of February 1, the company had 41.15 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
